        "\n",
        "4. Apply color adjustments and canvas sizing.\n",
        "   - Use `resize` or `crop` early in the action pipeline to establish compo",
        "sition geometry.\n",
        "   - Use `adjust_color` with `brightness` (-100..100) and `contrast` (-100.",
        ".100) on target layers for grading.\n",
        "   - If delivering flat web assets (e.g., PNG or WEBP), include `flatten` a",
        "t the end of the action chain.\n",
        "   - **Done when:** geometric and tonal parameters match design requirement",
